    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0020",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s01-p018-06795-s005",
      "sentenceText": "If you are unhappy, you are a loser.",
      "sentenceSha256": "507516aedd742ec1ce810736bfa9761de939091383d47c70167c693b5d91f02b",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s01-p018-06795-r005-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-039",
      "parentFingerprint": "b4ef3c8c5652fd9d920479b03ffcde0303e8b027a02349d6ff32a19566c24f66",
      "passageSha256": "42df74b5b58c01b69487a907206f83e5176754370336576b25f3b1ddee1350b0",
      "pdfPages": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0021",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s02-p019-02235-s001",
      "sentenceText": "What happiness researchers found was quite different from the achievement-oriented concept of happiness; a victory rarely results in everlasting (or even long-lasting) happiness.",
      "sentenceSha256": "ad1e192f6c6b2b2fbe38fbdb1a2b834906322a70388ed16aca93504f28dd4ed5",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s02-p019-02235-r001-002",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-040",
      "parentFingerprint": "fd16860e46487e0cc101c18f898b0f59b028bc2cf56d13568cf84ff3b79bb0b6",
      "passageSha256": "298a33c553f6987a1fdce90e2605741ac87a00567afddd4ee7dfa6d6f90cc37a",
      "pdfPages": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0022",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s02-p019-02235-s005",
      "sentenceText": "It sounds like an obvious question.",
      "sentenceSha256": "dd3a094a47bac52c239a448d5e6c52b45cdd43ebb925c137b58cf2b78116674b",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s02-p019-02235-r004-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-041",
      "parentFingerprint": "36a9d794959ba170b081ab8234db98c64cd353d17f9d98efc1f14536b5b2042c",
      "passageSha256": "448c32f64a8cf3e0bb01b038ee9ac2b86dcdafe607ad528c9c2c2a76a30ec4a4",
      "pdfPages": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0023",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s02-p019-02235-s006",
      "sentenceText": "Indeed, the assistant professors all said they would be delighted if they got tenure and would be devastated if they were denied tenure.",
      "sentenceSha256": "ffb96f007d28ae6b09a417cb3994248a10ff19be39a9733662e80f1969c466ca",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s02-p019-02235-r004-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-041",
      "parentFingerprint": "36a9d794959ba170b081ab8234db98c64cd353d17f9d98efc1f14536b5b2042c",
      "passageSha256": "448c32f64a8cf3e0bb01b038ee9ac2b86dcdafe607ad528c9c2c2a76a30ec4a4",
      "pdfPages": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0024",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s02-p019-05550-s001",
      "sentenceText": "The first insight from the science of happiness is that people overestimate the role of success in their own happiness.",
      "sentenceSha256": "40e88b9d9a77eaf1310b8f23e4f058b34968817481cfc4f71372846236689809",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s02-p019-05550-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-043",
      "parentFingerprint": "a39fd85c5d0af0c8d4205cc80a55fbb2ade3e62e7dc7868d79232d6771c5977c",
      "passageSha256": "2b1a87169bf3eb5c9b9dc559a7191428cc1822f5ca5b9c44e3cff7d48224820d",
      "pdfPages": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0025",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s02-p019-05550-s002",
      "sentenceText": "The joy of a big promotion, marriage, or a first child is relatively short-lived.",
      "sentenceSha256": "328fcca80d233f9665be1b88a294b95293ce37cb6b2824119ffeaac150d63ed3",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s02-p019-05550-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-043",
      "parentFingerprint": "a39fd85c5d0af0c8d4205cc80a55fbb2ade3e62e7dc7868d79232d6771c5977c",
      "passageSha256": "2b1a87169bf3eb5c9b9dc559a7191428cc1822f5ca5b9c44e3cff7d48224820d",
      "pdfPages": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0026",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s02-p019-05550-s003",
      "sentenceText": "It is not a big win that brings happiness.",
      "sentenceSha256": "26da462ba0d8aade5d132ffaf9253a9cc54fd723132553889ce22b7db858aa92",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s02-p019-05550-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-043",
      "parentFingerprint": "a39fd85c5d0af0c8d4205cc80a55fbb2ade3e62e7dc7868d79232d6771c5977c",
      "passageSha256": "2b1a87169bf3eb5c9b9dc559a7191428cc1822f5ca5b9c44e3cff7d48224820d",
      "pdfPages": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0027",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s02-p019-05550-s007",
      "sentenceText": "That is, happiness is not personal success, but interpersonal success.",
      "sentenceSha256": "7fdfb7e90af1f35ef7ecb2842397e93a37afde17217c356e250218e9fce592a9",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s02-p019-05550-r005-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-006",
      "parentFingerprint": "9c1d63432c66492762bb62be5c31e78f9b391bcbbe7a47b62d4251a08da6823e",
      "passageSha256": "b956917e468733a3eec45b32aeeca471e5fb77986201d2beec22feaa1a802d1a",
      "pdfPages": [
        19,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0028",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s03-p020-01650-s001",
      "sentenceText": "So why do people fake happiness?",
      "sentenceSha256": "f00be3fbd312a33ee1feb0235f15018ce5d7ea506534ead28a03168bf92a4658",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s03-p020-01650-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-044",
      "parentFingerprint": "d684926f66613bde83c8b02acdfbf3660896cf696d3a3fad887533b1c31436eb",
      "passageSha256": "98a3d2d6d83d685d71079357f715d0b47d3405b32711ce043686625f19555506",
      "pdfPages": [
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0029",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s03-p020-01650-s002",
      "sentenceText": "There is, of course, the saying “Fake it till you make it.”",
      "sentenceSha256": "42aaf967d2522dda5a55e55d29f2de5d1cff730b67628f0088d5bd14b591963a",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s03-p020-01650-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-044",
      "parentFingerprint": "d684926f66613bde83c8b02acdfbf3660896cf696d3a3fad887533b1c31436eb",
      "passageSha256": "98a3d2d6d83d685d71079357f715d0b47d3405b32711ce043686625f19555506",
      "pdfPages": [
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0030",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s03-p020-01650-s004",
      "sentenceText": "Quentin Tarantino, who went on to write and direct the iconic film Pulp Fiction among others, was working as a clerk at a video store in Manhattan Beach, California, when, in order to get his first Hollywood job as a production assistant, he lied, saying that he had worked in the movie industry.",
      "sentenceSha256": "d1b8d293ffc93906bdde6d0d97d79b96bb48bdc5a6464bb87f3b53e92885cda8",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s03-p020-01650-r004-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-045",
      "parentFingerprint": "063fe4a9253f60c9e082e97cf85a82f1146b201a05ccca4699a69c9613a038c8",
      "passageSha256": "10dc5f70cf7f825f7967118bca11d55129709a5f7535af15b1b30eec05145b56",
      "pdfPages": [
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0031",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s03-p020-01650-s005",
      "sentenceText": "Steve Jobs faked it till he made it, too.",
      "sentenceSha256": "04ad54b55df2a413b5d109897b0c577d5d26b587e3a70899d7e963da5e1ffbdc",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s03-p020-01650-r004-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-045",
      "parentFingerprint": "063fe4a9253f60c9e082e97cf85a82f1146b201a05ccca4699a69c9613a038c8",
      "passageSha256": "10dc5f70cf7f825f7967118bca11d55129709a5f7535af15b1b30eec05145b56",
      "pdfPages": [
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0032",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s03-p020-01650-s009",
      "sentenceText": "It also had a bandwidth problem.",
      "sentenceSha256": "1ebf209151cbe71f5f7b587fd33d570fdc61d0e6486786684fa9b93b56e9182c",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s03-p020-01650-r008-009",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-046",
      "parentFingerprint": "cd04f7e926cae5e6c205e0bfb8a226136405cf18aacaabe8200d398b377614cc",
      "passageSha256": "6f7a9a46830888b063c93a8e77c174573466b36482ba1b6c3da4a7996666c255",
      "pdfPages": [
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0033",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s03-p020-01650-s010",
      "sentenceText": "So, when the iPhone onstage had a poor connection, they faked it and consistently showed five bars of signal.",
      "sentenceSha256": "66a5e9fabfaf2214ac8c24ade4f65a1b934e7b7dbfc01a67812b1566f6ae0cee",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s03-p020-01650-r010-012",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-013",
      "parentFingerprint": "85b741dc4976b3db4a203d2ca3f97bd8e6e06edd931726c773002e0337e646f7",
      "passageSha256": "c10b0120dfbf439a4e656036dd9f4f358a423f1492ff62bf38a0bf91c6f97a95",
      "pdfPages": [
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0034",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s03-p020-01650-s011",
      "sentenceText": "Eventually, Apple fixed the memory problem.",
      "sentenceSha256": "a80d9163959a2ac76ed4a8ab03f08128d067dacd49b8e5aefbec5d8052b9aa8b",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s03-p020-01650-r010-012",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-013",
      "parentFingerprint": "85b741dc4976b3db4a203d2ca3f97bd8e6e06edd931726c773002e0337e646f7",
      "passageSha256": "c10b0120dfbf439a4e656036dd9f4f358a423f1492ff62bf38a0bf91c6f97a95",
      "pdfPages": [
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 19,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0035",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s03-p020-04575-s001",
      "sentenceText": "We don’t know definitively whether most Americans assume pretending to be happy will make them happy.",
      "sentenceSha256": "3f9af940a97a5c66e0b648919a7402015403fcad80c1d9e58547f366f35f75b1",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s03-p020-04575-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-047",
      "parentFingerprint": "051bbd40cbda4bc05983685ca272ce7671cca0dd0315a9afe58495c00cdf0ab0",
      "passageSha256": "fd7b44e9dd181f5e92cdd2479dbb932631003968a78f7c4e1c7f8cef6c302924",
      "pdfPages": [
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 20,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0036",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s03-p020-04575-s002",
      "sentenceText": "Even so, there is a famous experiment in which participants held a pen in their mouth so as to mimic either smiling or not smiling.",
      "sentenceSha256": "ae2d8ab9b1b6564177a8bcea699d2df02c4eb1768d1d15d26957a1f61ff34a97",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s03-p020-04575-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-047",
      "parentFingerprint": "051bbd40cbda4bc05983685ca272ce7671cca0dd0315a9afe58495c00cdf0ab0",
      "passageSha256": "fd7b44e9dd181f5e92cdd2479dbb932631003968a78f7c4e1c7f8cef6c302924",
      "pdfPages": [
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 21,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0037",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s03-p020-04575-s004",
      "sentenceText": "What the researchers found was quite striking.",
      "sentenceSha256": "bd2e2c07bd86a5da736467d2f6896f27804338c371262258a9653b93ab7ca632",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s03-p020-04575-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-047",
      "parentFingerprint": "051bbd40cbda4bc05983685ca272ce7671cca0dd0315a9afe58495c00cdf0ab0",
      "passageSha256": "fd7b44e9dd181f5e92cdd2479dbb932631003968a78f7c4e1c7f8cef6c302924",
      "pdfPages": [
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 22,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0038",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s03-p020-04575-s006",
      "sentenceText": "Just moving their facial muscles to look like a smiley face made them enjoy the cartoons more.",
      "sentenceSha256": "e7439da106fc842b895e8bc0e6186aa33114dc66e0f100b93d8d75be07142c3d",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s03-p020-04575-r005-006",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-048",
      "parentFingerprint": "5306ab76711a4169296f5f8053ff501b84bb398dde2f44caf52774bb8ae76752",
      "passageSha256": "ccffc8db9a24c9d5af3c50d943945d182f943581825be12fcc0a46f53f7f9f55",
      "pdfPages": [
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 23,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0039",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s03-p020-04575-s008",
      "sentenceText": "Nonetheless, the original experiment has been mentioned in major news outlets.",
      "sentenceSha256": "a09c097e4635301e36dae233534586af4c81309e1a2e239d5befae2a7f90ae84",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s03-p020-04575-r007-009",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-007",
      "parentFingerprint": "d50bef69db15fd2f2612939e3cf87b44c44999ecea155659f01dc9abeacf3861",
      "passageSha256": "20eb0b55aff5d84edfbcfe517c72626247c1135f17e27e6db67cbe491343278f",
      "pdfPages": [
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 24,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0040",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s03-p020-04575-s009",
      "sentenceText": "As a result, many believe that when you are sad, you should put on a happy face.",
      "sentenceSha256": "e5b778a01733470499ed4a50d368ce4f0e1dbff483bfa4358d954082c00f7536",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s03-p020-04575-r007-009",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-007",
      "parentFingerprint": "d50bef69db15fd2f2612939e3cf87b44c44999ecea155659f01dc9abeacf3861",
      "passageSha256": "20eb0b55aff5d84edfbcfe517c72626247c1135f17e27e6db67cbe491343278f",
      "pdfPages": [
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 25,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0041",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s03-p020-06720-s001",
      "sentenceText": "There have also been many experiments in which participants were asked to behave like extraverts.",
      "sentenceSha256": "4e770abe065711d144be6ff2d08456da4f0f5cb29f5201aa1eebbefa4e76683c",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s03-p020-06720-r001-004",
